## 📋 Available commands

### Atomic stages (7)

| Command | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `{{ cmd }}research` | Gather context, prior art, library docs |
| `{{ cmd }}spec`     | Lock acceptance criteria (intent / outcomes / scenarios) |
| `{{ cmd }}plan`     | Deep interview → ADRs → phase decomposition |
| `{{ cmd }}execute`  | TDD machine — RED → GREEN per PLAN phase |
| `{{ cmd }}review`   | Multi-reviewer consensus + grade gate + auto-fix |
| `{{ cmd }}wrapup`   | Single commit, CHANGELOG, doc updates |
| `{{ cmd }}verify`   | Independent pre-wrapup invariant checks |

### Meta

| Command | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `{{ cmd }}make`      | Full re-render (interactive) |
| `{{ cmd }}configure` | Targeted setting change (no full re-interview) |
| `{{ cmd }}health`    | 3-layer audit (structural / external / personalization) |
| `{{ cmd }}loop`      | Bounded autoloop with safety rails |
| `{{ cmd }}uninstall` | Remove the harness |
| `{{ cmd }}help`      | (this command) |
| `{{ cmd }}metrics`   | Delivery metrics — CFR + churn trend, LLM interpretation (manual, read-only) |
## 🔁 Recommended workflow

```
  research ─► spec ─► plan ─► execute ─► review ─► verify ─► wrapup
```

Stages are chained by `{{ cmd }}loop` or by autopilot — there is no fused workflow command. <!-- @hm:axis-removed -->

